  "limits": [
    "Finite periods outside integer clock representation return local InvalidPeriod before mutation. Native store-then-cast behavior outside the safely qualified range is not copied.",
    "Double/Empty is one-way. Test stdin/stdout and processed-counter barriers do not add a remote completion reply.",
    "Same-topic providers have one selected recipient, without fanout or a stable first-created choice.",
    "Native later in-flight arrivals have no provider-generation fence. Reset retires old handed-off receiver queues.",
    "The full-system future-deadline native probe uses TPE. DART qualifies finite rate/reset behavior separately.",
    "Public capture ELF hashes differ from earlier prototype ELFs. Source, library and wire observations are bound; binary identity and its cause are not claimed."
  ]
